# Retinopathy of Prematurity (ROP) Classification

This package implements an engineering-quality system for ROP image classification using a Hybrid architecture (EfficientNet-B3 + Transformer + Fuzzy Logic Layer). 

## Requirements
- Python 3.9+
- PyTorch 2.0+

## Setup
Install the package and dependencies:
```bash
pip install -e .[dev]
```

## Training
To train the model, ensure your dataset is placed in the `Dataset` directory, organized in subfolders by class (`Normal`, `Stage_1`, etc.).
Modify `configs/default.yaml` as necessary, then run:
```bash
python scripts/train.py --config configs/default.yaml
```

## Inference
To run a prediction on a single image:
```bash
python scripts/predict.py --image path/to/image.jpg --checkpoint artifacts/checkpoints/best_model.pth
```

## Tests
Run the test suite using pytest:
```bash
pytest tests/
```
